    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭpĕr-indŭo</span></b> ,
			ŭi, ūtum, 3, v. a.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to put on
			over</i> other clothes (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paenulam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Ner. 48</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 5,
			12</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">superinduti substantiā aeternitatis,</span>”
				<i>clothed with</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Apol 48 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in hac carne domicilium indui solet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Res. Carn. 42</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
